widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
ymode=abs_bottom
layer=com_40
textfont=graphic_20452
text=The vast and mighty Bandos tried to conquer the world during the Fifth Age using a proxy Commander, but was thwarted by an adventurer’s interference.<br><br>With Guthix’s protection lifted from Gielinor, Bandos has returned in person and this time intends to finish the job, starting with his ancient avian foe. 
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffffff

